    "en": "Clic activities about solidarity based on the magazine: \n<b><i>Jatun Sunqu \"Corazón Grande\"</i></b>. These activities about solidarity have some texts, images, crosswords and puzzles with the aim to educate children to live in a more shared and common world.",
